[ERR-31481 : A rollbackable DDL execution fails, because the table has global non partitioned index ( NGM_NEG_SPLIT_I ).]

$T0> ALTER TABLE NGM_NEG_MERGE
        MERGE PARTITIONS P11, P12 INTO PARTITION P1;
[ERR-31481 : A rollbackable DDL execution fails, because the table has global non partitioned index ( NGM_NEG_MERGE_I ).]

